	"notes": [
		{
			"id": "At_5WclsWsui8vBS4",
			"text": "Typical Stats from the reviewed package: ST 1, DX 12, IQ 7, HT 12, HP 8, WILL 12, PER 12, FP 12, SPEED 6, MOVE 1, DODGE 9, DR 0. GCS derives its own values by applying the ancestry; where the two differ, the package's Typical Stats are what the Dungeons on Automatic encounter tables use."
		},
		{
			"id": "AaDakz5Hs5ghn-tMw",
			"text": "Encounter rating: CER 37 (offense 33, protection 4), threat tier standard, appearing 1."
		},
		{
			"id": "AxFG9VmdG8TebOdJv",
			"text": "Sting (1 point toxic), reach C: No attack roll and no active defense. No attack roll and no active defense. Contact agent: the target automatically takes 1 point of toxic damage unless wearing sealed armor. Natural DR does not help unless the creature keeps eyes, mouth, nose and ears shut. Retreating or dodging and dropping a yard away avoids it."
		},
		{
			"id": "ATyBOHbaoudHmm96m",
			"text": "Inhabit (Possession), reach C: Requires one minute of preparation in contact with the victim. The swarm parasitically possesses an SM-2 or larger creature and controls all its actions, or animates a corpse of up to 18 HP. An inhabited corpse grabs, lifts, strikes and throws at ST equal to its HP, uses the swarm's DX, and has Move equal to 18 minus the corpse's HP. Resolve as Possession with the Parasitic enhancement."
		},
		{
			"id": "AVUq2aA8jiM6EG7Bo",
			"text": "GCS ancestry draft: gcs/hellwasp-swarm.gct"
		},
		{
			"id": "A-OP6Fs_lCtjjfNwt",
			"text": "Source template total: 228 points."
		},
		{
			"id": "Ah9bMXJSI4sxM2Ua3",
			"text": "Library-rebuilt template total: 228 points."
		},
		{
			"id": "A2TO5rZVIFUH1NUkt",
			"text": "CER was computed from parsed Typical Stats using the Dungeons On Automatic baseline CER path."
		},
		{
			"id": "ATibdLFiJYyUTOy8Z",
			"text": "Review attacks, special abilities, encounter frequency, treasure, grappling, and GCS modifiers before approval."
		},
		{
			"id": "AfNHYC7rdLSvDZBg7",
			"text": "Swarm: the swarm is dispersed at 0 HP and destroyed at -HP; it cannot be slammed or grappled and is immune to crippling injuries (Diffuse, gnat-sized flying swarm). It seeps under doors and through screens, grates, clothing (2 seconds) and chinks in armor (5 seconds)."
		},
		{
			"id": "Ad4swZrRKdvSMiagV",
